    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325710/extras/3466654465322c857a0a2f270e9c9c4d.avif?t=1731398381\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashback Dream</strong> is a retro-modern pixel art action-adventure game. Players step into the role of Jin, a protagonist who finds himself lost in the mysterious realm of <i>Adonis</i>. As Jin, you'll explore the vast landscapes of this strange world, uncovering clues that may lead him back to his original world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure</strong><br>Explore various towns and sprawling forests, searching for clues to escape this enigmatic world. Speaking with the residents you meet along the way may reveal vital secrets about <i>Adonis</i>, bringing you closer to understanding its mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action</strong><br>To advance in your journey, you must confront the mysterious monsters known as <i>Nue</i>. Each <i>Nue</i> has a unique combat style, requiring strategic approaches to overcome. By timing your attacks carefully, you can unleash combos that deal high damage. With the coins earned from defeating foes, you can purchase new swords and shields to enhance your fighting abilities, gaining the strength needed to face even greater <i>Nue</i> threats.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325710/extras/3466654465322c857a0a2f270e9c9c4d.avif?t=1731398381\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashback Dream</strong> is a retro-modern pixel art action-adventure game. Players step into the role of Jin, a protagonist who finds himself lost in the mysterious realm of <i>Adonis</i>. As Jin, you'll explore the vast landscapes of this strange world, uncovering clues that may lead him back to his original world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure</strong><br>Explore various towns and sprawling forests, searching for clues to escape this enigmatic world. Speaking with the residents you meet along the way may reveal vital secrets about <i>Adonis</i>, bringing you closer to understanding its mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action</strong><br>To advance in your journey, you must confront the mysterious monsters known as <i>Nue</i>. Each <i>Nue</i> has a unique combat style, requiring strategic approaches to overcome. By timing your attacks carefully, you can unleash combos that deal high damage. With the coins earned from defeating foes, you can purchase new swords and shields to enhance your fighting abilities, gaining the strength needed to face even greater <i>Nue</i> threats.</p>",
    "short_description": "Flashback Dream is a retro-modern pixel art adventure. Jin, lost in &quot;Adonis&quot; where dreams are forbidden, must find a way home. Facing enemies and strict rules, can he survive? Join Jin\u2019s journey.",
